{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/13749-stigmatics-cryptids-exiles-and-more-other-cogs-in-the-machine","id":13749,"title":"Stigmatics, Cryptids, Exiles, and More: Other Cogs in the Machine","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-18T20:01:40-08:00","id":13749,"title":"Stigmatics, Cryptids, Exiles, and More: Other Cogs in the Machine","content":"While we've all come to love the stars of the show - Angels and Demons - there are many other beings who scurry about within the world of the God-Machine. This thread is mostly for discussing neat ideas for these things, and asking questions about them. I'd love to see some exciting Cryptid concepts and Stigmatic cults.<br /> <br /> The other two listed under Luminous Beings stood out to me immediately, though. Exiles are fascinating; Angels with no orders, and Demons who have returned to the God-Machine's service. Both make for fascinating characters; how would you stat one up, and would they be viable character options?<br /> <br /> The inclusion of <i>qashmallim</i> was an interesting one. The angelic servants of The Principle seem to have little in common; Pyros is very strongly divorced from natural Essence, and their 'master' is the polar opposite of the God-Machine's purposes. What role do they serve, and how would you use them?<br /> <br /> I've been struggling to find a satisfying use for the Gnostic dichotomy of Machine and Principle, with the former lording over the material while the latter is the 'true' divine. Could a ring of Unchained see service to The Principle, or be tasked by a <i>qashmallim</i> to instigate change? I just don't know a satisfying way to use them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T17:20:38-08:00","id":14994,"title":"","content":"&quot;Demons who have returned to the God-Machine's service. Both make for fascinating characters; how would you stat one up, and would they be viable character options?&quot;<br /> <br /> Well, <i>I </i>kind of want to run a loyalist Demon chronicle now. Honestly, the idea of trying to fight a superintelligent being because it's actions seem inexplicable is ... kinda dumb, viewed from the right perspective.<br /> <br /> Mechanics would be exactly the same, except Agendas relate to how you want to treat <i>Demons</i>; Integrators want to enlighten them, Saboteurs want to blow them up before they ruin everything ...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/877-mugasofer","name":"MugaSofer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar877_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T18:10:53-08:00","id":15020,"title":"","content":"&quot;The inclusion of <i>qashmallim</i> was an interesting one. The angelic servants of The Principle seem to have little in common; Pyros is very strongly divorced from natural Essence, and their 'master' is the polar opposite of the God-Machine's purposes. What role do they serve, and how would you use them?&quot;<br /> <br /> Well they both have wide ranging plans that touch upon the lives and actions of many others, in this way they can quite easily step on each others toes.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}